{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"n1","type":"group","label":"THE SIX LAWS — every decision below obeys these","x":-1700,"y":-1000,"width":4900,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"**1. Evidence is immutable**\nRaw files are read-only + SHA-256 hashed. No code path can modify them.","x":-1660,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"**2. The map is deterministic**\nGNN predictions NEVER enter the real graph. They live in a quarantined Sandbox.","x":-850,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"**3. Every edge has provenance**\nClick any edge → exact file, row/page, and the query that produced it.","x":-40,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"**4. Nothing without a citation**\nAI answers carry source badges. Uncited sentences are stripped by code.","x":770,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"**5. The graph is temporal**\nEvery edge decays. Default view is 'active now', not 'everything ever'.","x":1580,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"**6. Blocking before fuzzy**\nHard keys → Indic phonetics → embeddings. A wrong merge = a wrong arrest.","x":2390,"y":-940,"width":780,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"group","label":"1 · INGEST  —  01_Evidence_Inbox (READ-ONLY TIER)","x":-1700,"y":-550,"width":640,"height":1500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### Drag & drop evidence\nThe officer drops a folder in.\nThat is the entire interaction.","x":-1660,"y":-480,"width":560,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n10","type":"text","text":"**What goes in**\n• FIR PDFs (Hindi/English)\n• CDR CSV — 25,000+ rows\n• Tower dumps\n• Witness statements\n• Detective field logs","x":-1660,"y":-300,"width":560,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n11","type":"text","text":"### Classify\nBy extension + header sniff\n→ FIR | CDR | Tower | Statement","x":-1660,"y":-40,"width":560,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n12","type":"text","text":"### Hash & Lock  ⚠ LAW 1\nSHA-256 every file → write .sha256 sidecar\n→ chmod 0444 (read-only at OS level)\n→ audit log entry\n\n**Demo beat:** try to edit a file. It refuses.","x":-1660,"y":140,"width":560,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n13","type":"text","text":"### Verify on open\nEvery vault open re-checks all hashes.\nMismatch → status bar goes red.","x":-1660,"y":410,"width":560,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n18","type":"group","label":"2 · THE BRAIN  —  Python pipeline","x":-960,"y":-550,"width":680,"height":1500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n19","type":"text","text":"### CDR path (structured)\nDuckDB loads 25k rows in seconds.\n\n**Deterministic pre-filter rules:**\n• burst pair (N calls in 24h)\n• night spike (00:00–05:00)\n• IMEI↔IMSI swap chain\n• one-way pattern (A→B, never B→A)\n• tower co-location\n\n→ outputs ~200 candidate edges\n\n⚠ The LLM never sees a raw CDR row.","x":-920,"y":-480,"width":600,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n20","type":"text","text":"### FIR path (unstructured)\nPDF → text (+OCR if scanned)\n→ chunk, keeping page:line offsets\n→ GLiNER NER for name/phone spans\n→ Qwen extracts relations as strict JSON\n\n⚠ Devanagari is NEVER translated.\nsurface: 'विक्रम सिंह उर्फ विक्की'\nnormalized: 'Vikram Singh'","x":-920,"y":-110,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n21","type":"text","text":"### Entity Resolution  ⚠ LAW 6\n**1. BLOCK** — father's name, thana, MSISDN,\n   IMEI, plate. No shared key = never compared.\n**2. PHONETIC** — Indic Double Metaphone\n   (Vikas↔Bikash, Md→Mohammed)\n**3. VECTOR** — only inside a matched block\n\n≥0.92 auto-merge · 0.75–0.92 human queue","x":-920,"y":230,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n22","type":"text","text":"### Graph Writer  ⚠ LAW 3\nThe ONLY way an edge enters the graph.\n\n**Rejects any edge missing**\nsource_doc_id or locator.\nNot a warning — an exception.","x":-920,"y":550,"width":600,"height":180,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n23","type":"text","text":"### Analytics\n• PageRank / Betweenness / Degree\n• **Leiden + CPM** (not Louvain —\n  Louvain merges unrelated gangs)\n• Temporal decay w(t)=w₀·e^(−λΔt)","x":-920,"y":770,"width":600,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n29","type":"group","label":"3 · THE VAULT  —  02_AI_Brain (the only writable tier)","x":-180,"y":-550,"width":640,"height":1500,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n30","type":"text","text":"### A case is a folder\nPlain markdown. Portable.\nOpens in real Obsidian if our app dies.\nThat portability is a selling point.","x":-140,"y":-480,"width":560,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n31","type":"text","text":"### Delta_Log.md\nAppend-only changelog, one section per ingest.\n\n• New entities\n• New connections\n• Strengthened links\n• Contradictions found\n• Suggested next actions\n\nThe senior officer reads only this.","x":-140,"y":-300,"width":560,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n32","type":"file","file":"Sample Case/Suspects/Vikram Singh.md","x":-140,"y":0,"width":560,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n33","type":"file","file":"Sample Case/Organisations/Sonipat Arms Ring.md","x":-140,"y":300,"width":560,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n34","type":"file","file":"Sample Case/Events/2026-02-14 Kharkhoda Seizure.md","x":-140,"y":540,"width":560,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n35","type":"file","file":"Sample Case/Locations/Tower HR-SNP-0147.md","x":-140,"y":770,"width":560,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n38","type":"group","label":"4 · THE APP  —  pages & panels","x":560,"y":-550,"width":1400,"height":1500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n39","type":"text","text":"### The 3-pane shell\nDesktop only. One breakpoint. 1440×900.\n\n`[ left rail | center | right rail ]`\n+ timeline strip + status bar","x":600,"y":-480,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n40","type":"text","text":"## PAGE · Editor\nCodeMirror 6, markdown, 72ch column\n• `[[wiki-links]]` + autocomplete\n• frontmatter as a properties panel\n• Devanagari in Noto Sans","x":600,"y":-290,"width":640,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n41","type":"text","text":"## PAGE · Graph Canvas ★\nCytoscape.js, fixed layout seed\n\n**Edge style = evidentiary status**\n━━ solid amber   = verified\n━━ thick amber  = corroborated\n┄┄ faded amber  = decayed\n╍╍ dashed pink  = AI hypothesis\n━━ red + ⚠      = contradiction","x":600,"y":-80,"width":640,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n42","type":"text","text":"## PANEL · Timeline scrubber\nAlways visible. Drag the window →\nedges thin and thicken as they decay.\nThe best 10 seconds of the demo.","x":600,"y":210,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n43","type":"text","text":"## PANEL · Provenance Inspector ★★\nClick any edge →\nsource file · SHA-256 · row:4182 ·\nverbatim snippet · the exact query\n\n**This panel IS the product thesis.**","x":600,"y":400,"width":640,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n44","type":"text","text":"## PANEL · Copilot\nAsk a question → cited answer.\nIf it can't answer from the case file,\nit says so. That refusal is the feature.","x":600,"y":630,"width":640,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n45","type":"text","text":"## PANEL · Adjudication queue\nGrey-band merges, side by side.\nM = merge · R = reject · J/K = navigate\n50 pairs in two minutes, no mouse.","x":1290,"y":-290,"width":640,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n46","type":"text","text":"## PAGE · Ingest\nDrop zone → staging table\n(filename / kind / hash / size)\n→ commit → live progress","x":1290,"y":-90,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n47","type":"text","text":"## PAGE · Audit log\nHash-chained. Every write, every\nagent call, every export.\nTamper with a row → verify names it.","x":1290,"y":110,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n48","type":"text","text":"## MODE · Hypothesis Sandbox\nPress H. Magenta border + banner:\n`INVESTIGATIVE LEADS — NON-EVIDENTIARY`\n\nCannot be dismissed. Exiting removes\nevery predicted edge from view.\n\n⚠ CUT FROM THE 24H BUILD —\npresent the decision, not the model.","x":1290,"y":310,"width":640,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n49","type":"text","text":"## Everywhere · Keyboard\n⌘K palette · ⌘O switcher\n⌘⇧F search · F focus · H sandbox\n[ ] timeline step · ⌘E certificate","x":1290,"y":620,"width":640,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n53","type":"group","label":"5 · EXPORTS","x":2060,"y":-550,"width":700,"height":900,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n54","type":"text","text":"# ★★★ BSA §63 CERTIFICATE\n**The feature that wins the room.**\n\nSelect a subgraph → one click → PDF:\n1. Cover + case metadata\n2. Manifest: every file + SHA-256\n3. Every edge: source, row, timestamp\n4. The queries to reproduce it\n5. **Declaration: no AI touched this**\n6. Part A / Part B signature blocks\n7. Hash of the PDF itself\n\n⚠ If the selection contains ANY\nhypothesis edge → **EXPORT REFUSES**\nand names them. Demo that refusal.","x":2100,"y":-480,"width":620,"height":470,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n55","type":"text","text":"## Prosecution Dossier\nNarrative written by an agent,\nevery fact assembled by code.\n\n⚠ Cut from the 24h build.","x":2100,"y":30,"width":620,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n57","type":"group","label":"6 · THE AI AGENTS  —  orchestrator is CODE, agents are stateless calls","x":-1700,"y":1050,"width":4460,"height":620,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n58","type":"text","text":"### A1 · Extractor\nReads one FIR chunk.\nReturns entities + relations\nas strict JSON.\n\n**Never completes a name.**\n'विक्की' stays 'विक्की'.","x":-1660,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n59","type":"text","text":"### A2 · Resolver  ⚠ cut from 24h\nOnly for grey-band pairs.\nRecommends merge / don't.\nA human still decides.","x":-1030,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n60","type":"text","text":"### A3 · Cartographer\nWrites the suspect cards.\nEvery sentence carries\n^[source_id].\nBanned words: kingpin,\nmastermind, suspicious.","x":-400,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n61","type":"text","text":"### A4 · Delta\nWrites Delta_Log.md.\nThe DIFF IS COMPUTED IN CODE —\nthe agent only narrates it.","x":230,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n62","type":"text","text":"### A5 · Contradiction  ⚠ cut from 24h\nCode finds impossible\ntimelines. The agent only\nexplains them readably.","x":860,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n63","type":"text","text":"### A6 · Copilot\nGraph-RAG Q&A.\nA code validator strips any\nuncited sentence BEFORE\nit reaches the screen.","x":1490,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n64","type":"text","text":"### A7 · Dossier  ⚠ cut from 24h\nNarrative only.\nHashes, tables and queries\nall assembled by code.","x":2120,"y":1120,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n65","type":"text","text":"**ORCHESTRATOR = a Python state machine, not an LLM.**\nSTAGED → HASHED → LOCKED → PARSED → EXTRACTED → RESOLVED → GRAPH_COMMITTED → ANALYSED → CARTOGRAPHED → DELTA_WRITTEN → DONE\nEvery transition checkpointed. Every agent call: temp 0, thinking off, JSON schema validated, one retry, then loud failure. This is what makes it auditable.","x":-1660,"y":1440,"width":4380,"height":160,"color":"#C2569E"},
		{"id":"n66","type":"group","label":"7 · WHAT SHIPS IN 24 HOURS","x":-1700,"y":1760,"width":4460,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n67","type":"text","text":"## ✅ BUILDING\n1. Vault + editor + wiki-links + backlinks\n2. Ingest: hash + read-only lock\n3. CDR parser + 3 pre-filter rules\n4. Graph with enforced provenance\n5. Cytoscape canvas\n6. **Provenance Inspector**","x":-1660,"y":1830,"width":1440,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n68","type":"text","text":"## ✅ BUILDING (cont.)\n7. Blocking + phonetic resolution\n8. Centrality + Leiden\n9. Timeline scrubber\n10. **BSA §63 certificate**\n11. ONE agent (Cartographer)\n12. Synthetic case with planted truths","x":-160,"y":1830,"width":1440,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n69","type":"text","text":"## ❌ NOT BUILDING\nGNN sandbox · OCR · vector resolution ·\nadjudication UI · contradiction detector ·\ndossier PDF · audit viewer · Electron\n\n## 🛟 IF IT ALL BREAKS\nIngest+lock → graph+provenance →\ninspector → certificate.\nFour things. Still a full demo.","x":1340,"y":1830,"width":1380,"height":300,"color":"1"}
	],
